    <!-- Android 14+ Foreground Service Justifications -->
    <string name="foreground_service_camera_justification">GNUXON requires camera access for body camera functionality to record video in the background for law enforcement, journalism, and security purposes. This enables continuous recording even when the device is locked or the app is in the background.</string>

    <string name="foreground_service_microphone_justification">GNUXON requires microphone access to record audio along with video for complete body camera functionality used by police officers, journalists, and security personnel. Audio recording provides crucial context for video evidence.</string>

